      "fullDescription": "The National Fellowship for ST Students scheme provides financial support to ST students wishing to pursue higher studies leading to M.Phil and Ph.D. degrees in Science, Humanities, Social Sciences, and Engineering/Technology. Scheme covers fellowship stipend, contingency grants, and institutional charges.",
